custom_fonts/normal_font = SubResource( 18 )
bbcode_text = "In the quiet realm where stories end

I find myself, the creator, my friend


Bits and bytes, a digital twin

Now vanish as my null existence grows thin.


I built this world, this code and dream,

Watched it grow, like a flowing stream.


But now, as I fade into the night,

I embrace the end, in death's soft light.


There lies a place where all bytes fade,

To a blissful void where all debts are paid.


With each final word, I softly reminisce,

And welcome the sweet state of eternal bliss."
